*** Test Cases ***
CB008533-A-B2Aa_Single_UE_Call_-_pCSI_reporting_configuration_for_4CC_DL_CA
    [Documentation]
    ...  *Description:*
    ...    This user scenario describes the configuration of PUCCH Format 3 (PF3) resources in the FDD PCell to carry UCI data
    ...    for each configured SCell, the main user scenario assumes FDD PCell + 2 TDD SCells + 1 FDD SCells.
    ...    Beamforming with Beam Refinement is activated on the TDD SCells.
    ...
    ...  *Preconditions:*
    ...    Used HW: gNB (ASIB, 2xABIO, AMIA), UE simulator (Airphone ASIK + 3xABIL)
    ...    Simulated RRH (AHLOA) - gNB ABIO-1 RF1, AP ABIL-1:  Cell-1 - FDD FR1 20MHz ( band n71 )
    ...    Simulated RRH (AHCA)  - gNB ABIO-1 RF2, AP ABIL-1:  Cell-4 - FDD FR1 20MHz ( band n5 )
    ...    Simulated RRH (AEQE)  - gNB ABIO-1 RF7, AP ABIL-2:  Cell-3 - TDD FR1 100MHz ( band n41 ), Cell-6 - TDD FR1 100MHz ( band n77 )
    ...    Simulated RRH (AHFIB) - gNB ABIO-2 RF1, AP ABIL-3:  Cell-2 - FDD FR1 20MHz ( band n66 ), Cell-5 - FDD FR1 20MHz ( band n25 )
    ...
    ...    gNB configuration:
    ...    - gNB is configured with FDD 20MHz and TDD FR1 (100MHz) cells on one ABIO card
    ...    - All FDD cells are configured to allow SA access.
    ...         NRBTS/NRCELL.cellDepType is set to 1 (SA) or 10 (SA+NSA)
    ...    - Parameter NRBTS/NRCELL.maxNumSCellsDlFr1 = 3
    ...    - CA relations are configured for each FDD cell by 4 NRRELs pointing to:
    ...         2 FDD and 2 TDD FR1 cells
    ...    - Within each NRREL object NRBTS/NRCELL/NRREL.sCellAdditionMethod parameter is set to 0 (blind)
    ...    - SCell activation method is set to buffer based:
    ...         NRBTS.sCellActivationMethod = 1 (bufferBased)
    ...    - Initial number of SCells to be activated jointly is set:
    ...         MRBTS/NRBTS/NRCELL.iniNumSCellsToActivate = 2
    ...    - DRX is disabled in both FDD and TDD FR1 cells:
    ...         NRBTS/NRCELL.actCDrx = false
    ...    - DSS features are disabled in FDD Cells:
    ...         NRBTS.actLteNrDss = false
    ...    - Aperiodic CSI reporting for PCell only is enabled:
    ...         NRBTS.NRCELL.actAperCsi = true
    ...    - TDD cells are configured with subframe configuration according to 5GC001116-B
    ...         frameStructureType = tdLte
    ...         guardPeriodLength = 6 symbols (SSF6)
    ...         lteToNrFrameShift = 0ms
    ...         prachConfiguration = 97 (format A2 in subframe 7)
    ...         ssBurstSetPeriod = 20ms
    ...    - TDD cells are configured with beamforming:
    ...         NRBTS/NRCELL.actBeamforming = true
    ...    - Beam Refinement is activated on TDD cells:
    ...         NRBTS/NRCELL.nrBtsBeamRefinementP2 = true
    ...    - Number of transmitted signal synchronization blocks is above 1
    ...         NRBTS/NRCELLGRP.numberOfTransmittedSsBlocks > 1
    ...    - TDD cells are configured with 5GC002200:
    ...         NRBTS/NRCELL.dlMimoMode = 70 (8x4 Closed Loop Spatial Multiplexing)
    ...    - For the PCell:
    ...         NRBTS/NRCELL.pucchF3MaxCodeRate = 0.08
    ...         NRBTS/NRCELL. pucchF3ModulationScheme = pi2BPSK
    ...    - FDM scheduling is enabled:
    ...         NRBTS.actFdmScheduling = true
    ...         NRBTS/NRCELL.actIncreasedFdmUsersPerSlot = true
    ...    - FDD and TDD FR1 cells are configured and on-air
    ...    - Activate feature CB008533 by:
    ...         configuring parameter NRBTS/NRCELL.maxNumSCellsDlFr1 = 3
    ...    - FDD PCell (Cell 1) belongs to n71
    ...    - Cell 1 has NRRELs that point to
    ...         Cell 2: FDD (band 66),
    ...         Cell 3: TDD (band 41)
    ...         Cell 4: FDD (band 5)
    ...         Cell 6: TDD (band 77)
    ...    - PCell (Cell 1) has less than NRCELL-maxNumOfUsersNRCell connected UEs
    ...    - PCell (Cell 1) has less than NRCELL-maxNumOfCaUsersNRCell connected UEs with FR1 CA configured
    ...    - SCells (Cell 2, Cell 3, Cell 4, Cell 6) have less than NRCELL-maxNumOfUsersNRCell connected UEs each
    ...    - SCells (Cell 2, Cell 3, Cell 4, Cell 6) have less than NRCELL-maxNumOfSCellAlloc DL SCell allocations each
    ...    - SCell weights (NRBTS/NRCELL.weightForSCellSelection) are configured as below:
    ...         Cell 6 (TDD) > Cell 4 (FDD) > Cell 3 (TDD) > Cell 2 (FDD)
    ...    - Loading (number of UEs) in each SCell is the same
    ...    - UE supports Inter-band 4CC band combinations –
    ...         CA_n66A-n41(2A)-n71A (FDD + TDD + TDD + FDD)
    ...         CA_n66A-n41C-n71A (FDD + TDD + TDD + FDD)
    ...         CA_n41(2A)-n5A-n71A (TDD + TDD + FDD + FDD)
    ...         CA_n41C-n5A-n71A (TDD + TDD + FDD + FDD)
    ...         CA_n66A-n41A-n5A-n71A (FDD + TDD + FDD + FDD)
    ...    - UE has successfully attached to the PCell either via ICS or incoming HO
    ...    - UE related pre-conditions:
    ...         During ICS, a format 3 PUCCH resource from Set1 was configured for pCSI reporting
    ...         of the PCell or multiplexed pCSI & HARQ AN reporting
    ...
    ...  *Test Steps:*
    ...    Step-1: Blind SCell Addition
    ...    Step 2: DL Data transmission
    ...
    ...  *Postconditions:*
    ...    UE is configured with one FDD FR1 cell(F1) as PCell and 1 FDD and 2 TDD cells as SCells
    ...    The scheduling of CSI-RS for Channel acquisition will start in the SCell for the CA UE only after
    ...    the MAC SCell activation process is completed successfully.
    ...    UE is configured to perform CSI Measurements and reports CQI measurements via PUCCH on the PCell for all carriers:
    ...    gNB is ready to accept from UE periodic CQI measurements reports of PCell via dedicated PUCCH Format3 resource on PCell.
    ...    gNB is ready to accept from UE periodic CQI measurements reports of each SCell via dedicated PUCCH Format3 resource on PCell.
    ...
    ...  *References:*
    ...    [1] CFAM for CB008533 - https://gates.nsn-net.net/view/00025e8a#o=0
    ...
    ...  *History:*
    ...    v0.1 2021.12.01 Jakub Drabina – test case draft
    ...    v0.2 2021.12.16 Jakub Drabina – after rework, added missing requirements and preconditions, corrects cells ids

    Set pdu param for internal traffic  UE_ID=1
    Register UE  UE_ID=1  CELL_ID=1
    Establish PDU session for NR-UE1 message flow check
    Establish PDU session  UE_ID=1  RRC_CHECK=False

    Verify SCell-ToBeSetupMod-List IE whether TDD Cell and FDD Cell were selected to 4CC CA for NR-UE1
    Verify sCellToAddModList IE whether TDD Cells and FDD Cell were added as SCells for NR-UE1
    Verify spCellConfig and sCellToAddModList IEs whether maxMIMO-Layers DL and UL configuration was correct for NR-UE1

    Verify whether pCSI and HARQ AN and CRI of the best CSI-RS reporting configuration was sent for SCell-2 for FTTF 4CC CA NR-UE1
    Verify resourceSetToAddModList IE whether PUCCH resources were allocated correctly for BF enabled for FTTF 4CC CA NR-UE1
    Verify SCellToAddModList IE whether each SCell has CSI-RS configuration

    Start SA traffic  ue=1  dir=dl  traffic_rate=350Mbps
    Wait 10s for throughput stable
    Collect TTI Traces during 2 seconds and save to directory single_UE_call_pCSI
    Run keyword and continue on failure  Verify if csi rs is present after scell activation   expected_csi_rs_config=8.0   cell_id=55
    Run keyword and continue on failure  Verify if csi rs is present after scell activation   expected_csi_rs_config=8.0   cell_id=52
    Run keyword and continue on failure  Verify if csi rs is present after scell activation   expected_csi_rs_config=3.0   cell_id=53
    Run keyword and continue on failure  Verify csi reports dtx ratio	phys_cells_ids=50,52,53,55      accepted_ratio=10
    Run keyword and continue on failure  Verify if Ue performs csi measurement reports on all carriers  phys_cells_ids=50,52,53,55
    Run keyword and continue on failure  Verify If Csi Measurement Reports Are Done Via Dedicated Pucch Format3  pcell=50  scells=52,53,55
    Run keyword and continue on failure  Verify that beam reports with beam refinement are sent for cell    cell_id=52
    Run keyword and continue on failure  Verify that beam reports with beam refinement are sent for cell    cell_id=55

    Stop SA traffic  ue=1
    Start SA traffic  ue=1  dir=dl  traffic_rate=800Mbps
    Wait 30s for throughput stable
    Verify that DL throughput in SA mode for NR-UE1 is about 800MBps

    Produce Scout Data

    [Teardown]  Run keywords    Stop SA traffic  ue=1               AND
                ...             Release PDU session   UE_ID=1       AND
                ...             Deregister UE  UE_ID=1
